deep reinforcement learning systems with  very accurate simulators or a lot of  training data that is densely sampled  from the problem space and finally don't  forget if you want to dive into the nuts  and bolts of the algorithm behind  opening i-5 be sure to check out the  follow-up video to this episode which  will dive into proximal policy  optimization if you like this video and  you want to keep learning about AI don't  forget to subscribe my name is Xander  and I thank you very much for watching  archived insights  you
 

